Subject: [PATCH 2/2] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20command=20palette,=20mega=20menu=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?and=20scroll=20progress=20=E2=80=94=20zero=20new=20dependencies?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Navigation and search borrowed from three references, adapted rather than copied:

- AWS: a labelled 'Work' mega menu whose three columns (capabilities,
  repositories, live surfaces) are generated from app/lib/registry.ts, so the
  menu cannot drift out of sync with the page.
- Square: a search palette on Cmd/Ctrl+K with subsequence matching ('gos'
  finds GridOS), full keyboard navigation and a body-level portal so the
  overlay is never trapped inside the transformed header.
- Tesla: a hairline reading-progress rail pinned to the top of the viewport.

Implemented with React and CSS only. No next-themes, no framer-motion, no
cmdk, no shadcn — package.json is unchanged, so 'npm ci' stays reproducible
and there is no new supply-chain surface.
